# Google Calendar sync (Plan › Work & calendar). Optional: without it, import .ics files instead.
# Google Cloud console → APIs & Services: enable the Google Calendar API, then create an
# OAuth client ID of type "Web application" with this site's origin (e.g. http://localhost:5173)
# as an authorised JavaScript origin. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the ID.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
